{"_id": "6434cfc8c2d6e5b317551f3a", "name": "DTG | Classic Unisex T-shirt | Gildan 5000", "description": "<p><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Best material:</strong> Made by Gildan. You will love our classic T-shirt once you put them on and experience a perfect combination of softness and stretchiness. Each classic T-shirt is constructed with a high quality polyester and spandex blend to give you freedom of movement no matter what you’re doing.</li><li>Fabric: <span style=\"color:rgb(80,80,80);\">100% Cotton</span></li><li>GSM: Approximately <span style=\"color:rgb(80,80,80);\">180g</span>/m2</li><li><strong>Perfect Design:</strong> Double-needle neck, sleeves and hem, roomy unisex fit.</li><li><strong>Customization:</strong> We make classic T-shirt on demand, so give us your favorite design to create your one-of-a-kind T-shirt. Digital print is suited for outdoor sports, travel, punk rock dressing, walking, training sports or undershirts. Perfect pair with denim jeans, pants, shorts, coat, hats, sneakers, sandals to complete your style and become nice addition for your wardrobe.</li><li><strong>Gift of Love:</strong> A meaningful gift for your friends, family members, wife/husband, bridesmaid/groomsmen, coworkers on birthday, Mother's day, Father’s Day, wedding, anniversary, Christmas, engagement, Thanksgiving day, Valentine's day. A wonderful way to honor the memory of a special person or milestone.</li><li><strong>Garment Care</strong>: Machine wash or hand wash. Tumble dry on low heat. Avoid direct heat. Do not use bleach.</li><li><strong>Brand:&nbsp;</strong>Gildan - Heavy Cotton T-Shirt – 5000</li></ul><p><br><strong>SPECIFICATION</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Processing Time:</strong>&nbsp;3 – 5 working days average after payment and all designs updated correctly</li><li><strong>Packaging:&nbsp;</strong>1x Classic&nbsp;T-shirt</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>NOTE:</strong></p><ul><li>Actual color may be slightly different from the image due to different monitor and light effects.</li><li>Please allow 0.5-2 cm differences due to manual measurement.</li></ul>", "guideLine": "<p><strong>Print Guidelines</strong></p><p>Below is our complete selection of art templates used for designing within the full printable area of our products. Each template comes with a .png&nbsp;detailing Safe Area, Bleed, etc. Download templates and mockups &nbsp;here:</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://printwayfulfillment.jp.larksuite.com/drive/folder/BVbSf12elli8oZdgUEnjBeWXp2e\">Made in US</a></li><li><a href=\"https://printwayfulfillment.jp.larksuite.com/drive/folder/JT5gfmSy1la6SQdPjM7jFnXApLe\">Made in AU</a></li><li><a href=\"https://printwayfulfillment.jp.larksuite.com/drive/folder/ZU5cfBcIulx2iudLFfBjHp6Eprf\">Made in UK</a></li><li><a href=\"https://printwayfulfillment.jp.larksuite.com/drive/folder/WLVNfavNblYhwNdKj4njFszXpWb\">Made in EU</a></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>To use an Art Template:</strong></p><ul><li>Open the Printway template for your selected product in Photoshop or another design program.</li><li>Insert your artwork in a new layer,&nbsp;<strong>placing all important parts of your design within the designated “Safe zone” on the art template</strong>&nbsp;to ensure your design will not be cut off during the printing process.</li><li>If you’re designing drinkware, use the indicated centering lines to ensure your artwork is placed exactly where you’d like.</li><li>Hide or delete the Art Template layer from your file.</li><li>Save as a .png, .jpg, or another accepted file type.</li><li>You’ve now used a Printway template to create artwork exactly to the recommended specs for that product.<ul><li>Ensure all important elements of your design are within the safe zone on the product template.</li></ul></li></ul><p><strong>To ensure your design prints properly on each product:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Fill the entire design template!</strong>&nbsp;The outer edge of the template represents “Bleed Area,” which signifies the areas which may print on the outer edges of your product.</li><li><i><strong>Failure to fill the bleed area will likely result in unprinted white unprinted areas around the edge of your product.&nbsp;</strong></i></li></ul>", "displayPrice": {"EU": 10.35, "GB": 11.03, "AU": 7.75, "US": 7.15}, "mockupUrls": ["https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/651164de51de65703d5b6bcd_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/651164de2ca6a25ef311e160_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/6479c6ddc8706fd5e0fa5293_800x800.jpg", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/651164de3785e8161c60b30e_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/651164dea5c003fb2d067e74_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/651164deaf8b18e2bd8c8b20_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/651164de201a9242acf3f3ca_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/651164de9f47f1e619d8ef9c_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/651164de89f5bc999cfedf0d_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/683ea7b2de8a5d720be08b83_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/683ea7b2a49234aad5a5e5fc_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/683ea7b29e67a75f14c8d968_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/683ea7b2f2c96d078f5a31c5_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/686b44181e1536f9d8449b88_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/686ba1407fce7ad3ebceea0f_800x800.png"], "videoUrls": null, "choosenSupplier": null, "location": [{"locationId": "64055ac26d933e2c5d8dd733", "isEnabledTiktok": false, "name": "Made in US", "code": "US", "default": true, "suppliers": [{"_id": "642bfed73d90dada145248ba", "name": "Swift POD", "code": "SWP", "default": true}, {"_id": "642d47353d90dada1455f13d", "name": "Gearment", "code": "GM", "default": false}], "_id": "64055ac26d933e2c5d8dd733", "minTitaniumPrice": 7.45, "minDiamondPrice": 7.15}, {"locationId": "64365b21c2d6e5b3175a91d6", "name": "Made in EU", "code": "EU", "default": false, "suppliers": [{"_id": "64365f81c2d6e5b3175a9d66", "name": "Print&Logistic", "code": "PL", "default